# VSD reference image is a small fixed input asset, not generated data —
# keep it tracked despite the PlatoNeRF-main/data/ ignore rule above.
# (Need to un-ignore the directory itself too — git won't look inside an
# excluded directory to apply a more specific file-level negation.)
!PlatoNeRF-main/data/
PlatoNeRF-main/data/*
!PlatoNeRF-main/data/chair_smooth_walls.png

# Vendored custom_controlnet diffusion-prior package (src/ + configs/ only —
# the trained checkpoint final.pt is transferred separately, see
# mit_cluster_setup.md). Its own src/data/ subpackage would otherwise be
# swallowed by the bare "data" ignore rule above.
!custom_controlnet/src/data/
!custom_controlnet/src/data/**
